  "releaseNotes": "_New_\n- You can now directly call `new new ATL.Logging.ConsoleLogger();` from your code to have ATL output displayed to your console\n_Fixed_\n- WAV / RF64 (>4GB) files : Metadata subchunks added by ATL are now readable\n- WAV / RF64 (>4GB) files : Calling `Track::Remove(MetaDataIOFactory.TagType.NATIVE);` cleans up unreadable metadata located after the `data` subchunk\n- MP4/M4A : Ignore inconsistent Nero chapters (i.e. starting after the end of the track or before the preceding chapter)\n***Binaries are available from nuGet***",
